<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-DuPont said cut by Sanford.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-DuPont said cut by Sanford.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- DuPont Co's stock rating was cut by Sanford Bernstein &amp; Co, according to a source at the firm.</p>
<p>-- No further details were immediately available. Sanford Bernstein analyst Nicholas Spencer was also not available.</p>
<p>-- DuPont shares slipped 3/4 to 102-3/8. The stock was one of the most heavily traded issues on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
</text>
